  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Section 422(d), the aggregate FMV of stock (determined at grant date) for which ISOs become exercisable for the first time in any calendar year cannot exceed $100,000. Options exceeding this limit are automatically treated as NSOs.
Wrong (A): $50,000 is not the statutory annual limit for ISOs. The $100,000 limitation applies across all plans of the employer and related entities.
Wrong (C): $150,000 exceeds the statutory $100,000 annual limit under Sec. 422(d) and is incorrect.
