  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Sec. 83(a), without a Section 83(b) election, restricted stock is not taxed until the substantial risk of forfeiture lapses. At vesting, the full FMV of $120,000 is included in ordinary income. The employee missed the opportunity to be taxed on the lower $50,000 grant-date value.
Wrong (A): $0 is incorrect because taxation occurs at vesting when the forfeiture risk lapses. The employee cannot avoid taxation indefinitely.
